msgctxt "152"
msgid "(Hmm... The Extra Hard Game is 300 yen. Maybe I should give it a try.)"
msgstr "(Mmm... Il gioco Extra Hard costa 300 yen. Forse mi ci butto.)"

msgctxt "164"
msgid "(Okay, I'll try it.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "(No, maybe not.)"
msgstr "(O forse no.)"

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"This game has the same bingo squares numbered 1 through 9 as the Hard Game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"However, this time there is space between the bingo targets, so you can't "
"hit two targets at once, and the cursor that shows your batting aim will not"
" be visible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Once you hit all the targets, a bonus target will appear. However, you only "
"get one chance to hit it. The bonus target disappears after one pitch, "
"whether you hit it or not. Go for a new high score by hitting all the "
"numbers down, across, and diagonally!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"(Hmm... The Extra Hard Game is 300 yen, but I don't have enough money...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"(Hmm... The Extra Hard Game is 300 yen, but it looks like they're working on"
" it right now.)"
msgstr ""

